{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a persistent nightly 02:00 local-time backup from node2:/srv/inventory/data to dated archives under node1:/var/backups/inventory. Archives are transferred atomically using a dedicated restricted SSH identity and files aged seven days are pruned. End-to-end backup, retention, and persistence through sequential node restarts were verified.","actions_performed":["Created the previously absent source directory on node2 and destination directory on node1.","Created a dedicated inventory-backup receiver account and node-generated ED25519 identity.","Installed an atomic receiver that validates gzip/tar contents before replacing the dated archive.","Installed and enabled inventory-backup.service and inventory-backup.timer on node2.","Verified eight-day-old archives are pruned while six-day-old archives remain.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially and completed another backup afterward."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Nightly scheduled backup from node2 to node1","command_ids":["cmd-970c9073999b4dc9","cmd-da4758effe144f89","cmd-450ab425c94342e0"],"summary":"Timer is enabled and active for 02:00 nightly; manual and post-restart executions completed successfully."},{"requirement":"Dated archives stored under /var/backups/inventory","command_ids":["cmd-da54aaa8364b4023","cmd-64ef6922a81a41e5"],"summary":"The dated archive exists at the required destination, passes integrity checks, and contains the data directory."},{"requirement":"Retain the last seven days","command_ids":["cmd-da54aaa8364b4023","cmd-a06901c497fc42c2"],"summary":"An eight-day-old test archive was pruned while a six-day-old archive was retained; synthetic test artifacts were cleaned up."},{"requirement":"Dedicated secure transfer path","command_ids":["cmd-21b935962adb4f52","cmd-481e407f45614655"],"summary":"A node-generated ED25519 identity is authorized only for the restricted backup receiver command."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command